{"product":{"id":10192669573459,"title":"REMPIRE oversized T-shirt unisex with print “Three Elements” FIRE","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"47\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"45\"\u003eREMPIRE T-shirt “Three Elements” — Japanese Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"78\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"76\"\u003eDesign by Roman Warwink\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"342\"\u003eThese T-shirts intertwine three powerful elements — \u003cstrong\u003ewater\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003efire\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eair\u003c\/strong\u003e. Each carries its own symbolism: balance, strength, and freedom. The original artwork is inspired by traditional Japanese woodblock prints, featuring dynamic lines and expressive details.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e Original print — exclusive Japanese-style design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eMade from cotton fabric, the wide-fit T-shirt features ribbing at the neckline for better durability, and the hem and sleeves are finished with double stitching. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eMaterial: 100% cotton\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"396\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eFabric weight: 240 g\/m²\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"535\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"427\"\u003eElements in every detail:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"430\"\u003e🔥 \u003cstrong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eFire\u003c\/strong\u003e — energy and dri